Penny here. Three taps and you have a planning routine. Not sure and Skip are always there.
```yui
plan@first "Your first routine" submit="Set my routine"
pick@busy "Which days are packed?" "Mon"|"Tue"|"Wed"|"Thu"|"Fri"|"Sat"|"Sun"|"None"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
choose@plan "When do you plan?" "Sunday night"|"Monday morning"|"Each morning"|"Each night"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
choose@remind "How do you want reminders?" "At the time"|"10 minutes before"|"The night before"|"None"|"Not sure"|"Skip"
end
```
